        "confirm": {
          "description": ""yes": the reviewer, or the thread it was sent to, answered yes to exactly what was shown; give the same input again. "just-post-it": the reviewer's own message, or the relayed one, says to post it without showing it first ("just post it"; for request changes, the message is only that command: "just request changes").",
          "enum": [
