        },
      },
      "required": [
        "threadId",
      ],
      "type": "object",
    },
    "instructions": "Resolve or unresolve a thread when the reviewer asks, with resolve_thread. On someone else's PR, push back once before changing its labels, reviewers, assignees, title or description, resolving its threads, or closing it, and offer a comment instead; then do what the reviewer says. Post, approve, merge, close or push only with these tools, never with gh, gh api or git push in your shell.",
    "name": "resolve_thread",
    "presentation": null,
  },
  {
    "description": "Act on this PR on GitHub as the reviewer: comment; edit its title or description; add or remove labels, reviewers (a team as org/slug) or assignees; close, reopen or merge it; mark it ready for review or a draft. A comment, an edit, closing and merging show the reviewer exactly what happens, with a button naming it, first.",
